error[KL1007]: invalid quantity `0.5cores` for `cpu`: `cores` is not a quantity suffix
  --> correctness/KL1007.yaml:18:18
   |
18 |             cpu: 0.5cores
   |                  ^^^^^^^^
  = help: CPU is counted in cores without a unit: write `0.5` or `500m`

